              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Paula"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Necessity is the mother of invention. My tortillas were too large, so I just cut two hot dogs in half lengthwise and laid them on the tortilla side by side, along with mustard and grated cheese, and folded the tortilla in half. Still just as good for an easy lunch. I did cut the final product in half for easier handling.",
