              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Vicky"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was an easy quick thing to make when you're really hungry and don't have time to make something fancy. I tried it with mozza cheese as that's all I had on hand and it was good. I didn't like dipping it in the ketchup, I think it tasted better by itself. thanks for the recipe!",
